# Foresee ({3}{U} sorcery, "Scry 4, then draw two cards.") — seat 0 holds it
# and four untapped Islands, an uncontested turn-1 Main Phase 1. Four
# different basics on top of the library, so every card the scry looks at
# can be told apart, and the two Foresee draws show which order stuck.
# `e2e/scry-one-prompt.spec.ts` drives it.
